{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "scale-county-outstep-week-runspec",
    "description": "PLAN.md §7.3.66, step 7f. `scale-county-outstep-week`: CO and NOx at running exhaust, start exhaust and extended idle for the passenger car and the combination long-haul truck at Washtenaw County SINGLE scale, January and July 2020, both day types, all 24 hours, `<aggregateBy key=\"24-Hour Day\"/>` and `<outputtimestep value=\"Portion of Week\"/>`, over the time-aggregation county database. MOVESOutput is 8,752 rows, 2,188 per (month, day type), hourID NULL.\n\nWHAT IT DISCRIMINATES is the Portion of Week output step: OutputTimeStep PORTION_OF_WEEK does not `usesClassicalDay`, so AggregationSQLGenerator neither converts to a classical day nor to the month's weeks, and each row is the day type's portion of a WEEK -- exactly `noOfRealDays` times the 24-Hour Day row (`scale-county-outstep-dayagg`, the same run at that step: 2.000000 and 5.000000 on all 7,636 nonzero rows, within the v2 storage). The model multiplies by `noOfRealDays` (`outStepWeeks`) with `n_outputClassicalDay` 0.\n\n`n_outputRate` is bound to 2188, recomputed as `rateSurvivorCount`.\n\n`db_movesoutput` is DECLARED AND CONSUMED BY NOTHING, as in every RunSpec here.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "fixture",
      "onroad",
      "default-database",
      "single-county-domain",
      "road-type-axis",
      "off-network-idle",
      "hotelling-adjustment",
      "time-aggregation",
      "starts",
      "output-time-step"
    ]
  },
  "data_sources": {
    "db_runspecyear": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-county-outstep-week/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecyear.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecyear"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, yearID 2020. The scope comes from these tables and never from the RunSpec XML, whose @key attributes are 0-based indices into sorted ID lists (docs/mixed-onroad.md §0.1).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspecmonth": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-county-outstep-week/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecmonth.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecmonth"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "2 rows, monthIDs 1 and 7 (`<month key=\"0\"/>` and `\"6\"` are 0-based).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspechour": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-county-outstep-week/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspechour.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspechour"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, hourID 0 -- the SYNTHESIZED `Entire Day` PreAggDAY.sql writes into HourOfAnyDay, not an hour of the clock. The RunSpec selects all 24 hours.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_aggregationhour": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../movesdb/HourOfAnyDay.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_aggregationhour"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "THE 24 HOURS EACH DAY TYPE IS COLLAPSED OVER: the default database's own `HourOfAnyDay`. `<aggregateBy key=\"24-Hour Day\"/>` collapses every hour of the day before any generator runs (PreAggDAY.sql).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspecday": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-county-outstep-week/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspechourday.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecday"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "2 rows, hourDayIDs 2 and 5: PreAggDAY.sql's collapsed HourDay, `hourDayID = dayID` at hourID 0, which the default `hourday` does not hold. `rsd_dayID` and `rsd_hourID` unpack it as the SQL does (`mod(hourDayID,10)`, `floor(hourDayID/10)`), so each cell is its day type at the synthesized hour.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_rateday": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-county-outstep-week/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecday.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_rateday"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "2 rows, dayIDs 2 and 5: this run's own `runspecday`. PreAggDAY.sql does not touch the day types, so the selection survives in the execution database.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_actday": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-county-outstep-week/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecday.parquet"
